    <entry key="customDescription" type="xstring" value="Exercise 1: How many TV registration records does each brand have available in Australia? Teaching snapshot: 15 February 2026. Raw: 4,724; available: 4,710; Australia: 4,508; cleaned brands: 73. Counts are registrations, not sales. Duplicate models are not removed, following the class exercise; see README for limitations. GenAI-assisted preparation: OpenAI Codex, 10 October 2026. Brand aliases include samsung electronics -&gt; samsung, q.bell -&gt; qbell, and s vision -&gt; svision. Hubbl Glass is grouped under Hubbl for brand-level analysis; this is a product-line grouping, not a spelling correction. Hubbl group: 3 Available Australian registration records."/>
